  <TITLE>
    <TI>
      <P>Information procedure — Technical rules</P>
      <NO.DOC.C>(2004/C 242/03)</NO.DOC.C>
      <P>(Text with EEA relevance)</P>
    </TI>
  </TITLE>
  <CONTENTS>
    <P>Directive 98/34/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council of<DATE ISO="19980622">22 June 1998</DATE>laying down a procedure for the provision of information in the field of technical standards and regulations and of rules on Information Society services. (<REF.DOC.OJ COLL="L" DATE.PUB="19980721" NO.OJ="204" PAGE.FIRST="37">OJ L 204, 21.7.1998, p. 37</REF.DOC.OJ>;<REF.DOC.OJ COLL="L" DATE.PUB="19980805" NO.OJ="217" PAGE.FIRST="18">OJ L 217, 5.8.1998, p. 18</REF.DOC.OJ>).</P>
    <GR.SEQ LEVEL="1">
